WEBVTT

00:13.580 --> 00:14.660
Your Highness!

00:14.660 --> 00:16.240
Please spar with me, too!

00:17.130 --> 00:18.200
Very well.

00:24.270 --> 00:25.580
Anyone else interested?

00:32.210 --> 00:33.260
Tinasha.

00:35.180 --> 00:36.090
Come here.

00:36.090 --> 00:37.320
Absolutely not.

00:37.320 --> 00:39.010
Why did you refuse immediately?

00:39.010 --> 00:41.470
I know there's nothing in it for me.

00:41.760 --> 00:43.110
It will serve as training.

00:44.100 --> 00:45.810
You can use magic if you'd like.

00:49.310 --> 00:52.410
<i>How powerful will this man become?</i>

00:52.990 --> 00:57.730
<i>Perhaps he's the one 
who can kill a witch like me.</i>

01:02.130 --> 01:03.400
Understood.

01:03.400 --> 01:04.410
I'll take part.

01:05.570 --> 01:08.380
However, I'd like you to use Akashia.

01:16.140 --> 01:17.390
You can attack at any time.

01:18.440 --> 01:20.410
I'll do just that, then.

01:23.350 --> 01:24.590
Hmm...

03:05.160 --> 03:09.960
~ A Breath of Life into Image ~

03:14.170 --> 03:16.630
Man, they were amazing.

03:16.630 --> 03:19.100
Both Miss Tinasha and His Highness.

03:19.100 --> 03:23.490
So that's how you use magic for close combat.

03:23.490 --> 03:27.220
Most mages let the swordsmen 
take the front lines,

03:27.220 --> 03:29.850
and stay in the back 
firing big spells instead.

03:29.850 --> 03:34.190
I've never seen a mage who uses a sword 
to cover their offense and defense.

03:34.480 --> 03:37.850
It looked like she was
 testing His Highness to me.

03:37.850 --> 03:40.640
Or rather, trying to teach him.

03:40.640 --> 03:41.280
What?

03:41.780 --> 03:44.160
After all, she was smiling.

03:53.710 --> 03:56.150
<i>So he really </i>can<i> see them.</i>

03:57.630 --> 03:59.370
Let's leave it at that for today.

04:00.300 --> 04:03.130
These swords are no good anymore.

04:08.810 --> 04:12.700
These are light wounds 
considering you were using magic.

04:12.700 --> 04:14.140
Did you go easy on me?

04:14.490 --> 04:16.140
That's not the case.

04:16.140 --> 04:19.350
Complicated spells 
require incantations and focus.

04:19.790 --> 04:23.330
To be honest, I wouldn't want to fight 
in close quarters with you again.

04:27.850 --> 04:30.910
I really don't want to kill you, after all.

04:31.340 --> 04:32.620
How naive of you.

04:33.180 --> 04:34.750
Do you want to die?

04:37.550 --> 04:41.250
No, I still have plenty I want to do.

04:42.250 --> 04:44.380
Like breaking that curse on you.

04:44.730 --> 04:47.390
If you become my wife, that'd be fine as well.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.610
I refuse!

04:48.610 --> 04:50.820
Do you realize how much older I am?

04:56.930 --> 05:00.420
An envoy from the tiny nation 
of Cuscull, to the north, has arrived.

05:01.080 --> 05:04.910
He wants to see the Witch of the Azure Moon.

05:04.910 --> 05:07.530
How does he know that Tinasha is here?

05:09.210 --> 05:11.110
I'm not too sure myself.

05:11.620 --> 05:14.110
For now, he insists on meeting her.

05:14.590 --> 05:17.420
I was thinking of leaving this matter to you.

05:17.420 --> 05:18.290
How about it?

05:19.210 --> 05:20.250
I understand.

05:20.250 --> 05:21.670
I'll see him first.

05:25.630 --> 05:28.640
<b>Kagar    Envoy from Cuscull</b>

05:26.010 --> 05:28.340
My name is Kagar.

05:28.340 --> 05:33.100
All I ask is for a brief audience 
with the great witch herself.

05:33.410 --> 05:36.310
Unfortunately, we don't have any witches here.

05:36.670 --> 05:40.650
I'd like to know how you got 
that idea in your head.

05:40.920 --> 05:43.120
Surely you jest.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.610
I won't take much of Your Highness's time.

05:45.980 --> 05:48.490
I'm well aware that she resides in this castle.

05:48.490 --> 05:51.580
Lady Tinasha, or should I say, Lady Aeti.

05:55.180 --> 05:56.100
Huh?

05:58.020 --> 05:59.210
Where's Oscar?

05:59.650 --> 06:02.290
His Highness is out at the moment.

06:04.530 --> 06:05.690
Is that so?

06:05.690 --> 06:07.200
That's fine, then.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.920
I didn't have any business with him.

06:08.920 --> 06:10.970
Excuse me, Lady Tinasha.

06:12.260 --> 06:15.530
I haven't introduced myself yet.

06:16.560 --> 06:23.050
I began serving His Highness as a maid 
after being introduced by General Ettard.

06:23.460 --> 06:25.030
My name is Miralys.

06:25.030 --> 06:26.220
I see.

06:26.220 --> 06:30.570
But I also know the true reason 
you're here at the palace.

06:30.570 --> 06:31.120
What?

06:31.120 --> 06:33.550
H-How do you know that?

06:34.480 --> 06:36.500
I can tell by looking at you.

06:36.500 --> 06:39.030
So please, pay me no mind.

06:41.490 --> 06:45.550
Hey, I heard you had a sparring match with him.

06:45.550 --> 06:47.840
How do you know that?

06:47.840 --> 06:49.760
And before that, why are you here?

06:50.070 --> 06:51.580
I'm here for some tea.

06:53.620 --> 06:57.130
Do you have a death wish, 
showing him how you fight?

06:57.130 --> 06:59.140
He said the same thing.

06:59.140 --> 07:02.170
That man is strong enough without your help.

07:02.170 --> 07:06.020
I don't need the owner 
of that sword getting any stronger.

07:07.020 --> 07:12.490
If staying neutral is getting to you, 
just give up or whatever already.

07:13.740 --> 07:15.450
I suppose you're right.

07:17.170 --> 07:20.780
<i>I'm not sure myself 
why I felt like fighting him.</i>

07:21.290 --> 07:28.800
<i>I just felt it might be nice to have someone 
who could kill me if anything happens.</i>

07:29.620 --> 07:33.380
<i>Perhaps I've grown tired of continuing 
my search for that person.</i>

07:35.120 --> 07:37.690
Lady Tinasha, do you have a moment?

07:37.690 --> 07:38.220
Yes.

07:38.730 --> 07:42.230
We have a guest who wants to see you, Aeti.

07:42.230 --> 07:43.570
Okay.

07:43.570 --> 07:44.440
Ah...

07:46.370 --> 07:48.570
So it really was your name.

07:55.140 --> 07:58.040
It's an honor to be 
in your presence, Lady Aeti.

07:58.380 --> 08:00.500
Please stop calling me by that name.

08:00.500 --> 08:01.650
My apologies.

08:01.650 --> 08:04.960
Would it suffice to call you 
Lady Tinasha, then?

08:04.960 --> 08:06.210
Fine by me.

08:06.210 --> 08:08.840
So, what do you want with me?

08:09.160 --> 08:16.420
Actually, Cuscull's founding has restored 
the rights of mages persecuted in Tayiri,

08:16.420 --> 08:20.180
and our main goal is to utilize 
and develop their skills.

08:20.180 --> 08:26.060
We beseech you to come to Cuscull and lend 
your knowledge to expand even further.

08:26.060 --> 08:27.330
What?

08:27.330 --> 08:30.970
I'm here as this man's protector.

08:30.970 --> 08:33.150
Nothing more, nothing less.

08:33.820 --> 08:37.160
I only agreed to let you
 meet me on his behalf.

08:37.870 --> 08:43.180
So why should I listen to someone 
who hasn't even climbed my tower,

08:43.180 --> 08:45.620
and what's more, lend them my support?

08:46.080 --> 08:47.210
Please...

08:47.210 --> 08:48.230
Away with you.

08:53.410 --> 08:54.380
Damn it!

08:54.380 --> 08:57.430
I was sure she'd come if I used that name!

08:57.430 --> 08:59.240
I can't go back empty-handed!

08:59.240 --> 09:02.270
I need to at least separate 
those two from each other...

09:14.940 --> 09:16.270
Lucrezia.

09:17.980 --> 09:19.440
Perfect timing.

09:19.440 --> 09:21.850
Do you know of the nation of Cuscull?

09:21.850 --> 09:22.720
Huh?

09:22.720 --> 09:24.200
Never heard of it.

09:24.200 --> 09:28.270
They're a collection of mages who 
proclaimed independence this past year.

09:28.270 --> 09:29.720
Hmm...

09:29.720 --> 09:34.260
Oh, have you noticed the ripples of strange 
magic emanating from the north lately?

09:34.570 --> 09:39.910
They're subtle, sporadic fluctuations 
similar to those from a magical lake.

09:40.470 --> 09:42.050
A magical lake...

09:42.050 --> 09:43.680
Hey! Meredina!

09:52.220 --> 09:53.440
What's going on here?

09:53.440 --> 09:55.110
No, this is...

09:55.110 --> 09:57.120
You conniving woman, deceiving men's hearts!

09:57.120 --> 09:58.820
Leave this country at once!

10:00.910 --> 10:01.870
Meredina!

10:03.530 --> 10:06.730
I've heard similar accusations many times.

10:07.240 --> 10:10.940
But I have not once tried to tempt anyone.

10:11.610 --> 10:14.420
She's the one getting worked up over nothing.

10:14.820 --> 10:18.100
I've never desired anyone's heart.

10:20.570 --> 10:23.680
That woman's under mind control.

10:23.680 --> 10:24.980
Let go!

10:24.980 --> 10:25.950
Can you undo it?

10:26.670 --> 10:28.140
Why me?

10:28.530 --> 10:29.600
Please.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.830
It won't come cheap.

10:36.490 --> 10:37.530
Let me see her.

10:40.290 --> 10:43.240
When was the last time you cried?

10:44.970 --> 10:46.510
I don't remember.

10:57.890 --> 10:59.990
I'm finished treating her.

11:02.130 --> 11:03.900
Thanks a lot.

11:19.360 --> 11:22.570
What'd you call me out here for?

11:25.280 --> 11:29.250
I've sent out a familiar to look into Cuscull.

11:30.300 --> 11:34.190
So starting today, I want you to spar with me.

11:34.670 --> 11:35.880
What?

11:36.220 --> 11:39.410
I'll be careful not to die, 
so please do your best.

11:48.130 --> 11:50.810
Not bad for the first day, I guess.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.640
Why are you doing this?

11:52.910 --> 11:54.460
Let me think.

11:54.460 --> 11:58.320
There's more than one reason, 
but if I had to sum it up...

11:58.320 --> 12:01.610
I want you to have lots 
of options available to you.

12:01.970 --> 12:03.090
Options?

12:03.700 --> 12:06.290
No matter what happens in the future,

12:06.290 --> 12:11.580
I don't want you to regret that your lack 
of strength has closed off a path.

12:11.990 --> 12:17.370
I want you to choose the path you want, 
from as many options as possible.

12:17.370 --> 12:18.670
That's my reasoning.

12:20.220 --> 12:23.830
I'll see you here tomorrow, too.

12:23.830 --> 12:25.980
Feel free to come 
after your official duties.

12:40.250 --> 12:41.740
That ends my report.

13:10.760 --> 13:12.490
It's two against one.

13:12.490 --> 13:13.600
Will you be okay?

13:13.600 --> 13:15.190
This much is nothing!

13:15.190 --> 13:16.530
I see.

13:16.530 --> 13:17.650
In that case...

13:29.110 --> 13:30.910
Something caught my leg.

13:30.910 --> 13:33.090
It was a magic vine.

13:33.090 --> 13:35.580
I believe you should be able to see them.

13:35.580 --> 13:36.120
Huh?

13:37.230 --> 13:40.500
You dodged it when we sparred in the palace.

13:40.500 --> 13:43.660
Don't let your mental state 
affect your fighting.

13:44.290 --> 13:45.840
Let's call it a day for today.

13:49.650 --> 13:52.220
You must be more exhausted than usual.

13:52.220 --> 13:53.820
Let's rest at the top...

13:55.060 --> 13:55.820
Eh?

13:55.820 --> 13:56.940
Ah, hey...

13:57.410 --> 13:59.130
Don't fall asleep here!

14:08.630 --> 14:09.900
Where am I?

14:26.100 --> 14:27.430
You're awake?

14:28.790 --> 14:30.680
You're completely unguarded.

14:30.680 --> 14:33.010
I was concentrating.

14:33.010 --> 14:35.640
I'm sure I'd notice if there was an intruder.

14:35.640 --> 14:37.180
Not what I mean.

14:37.180 --> 14:39.100
Be angrier when someone touches you.

14:39.480 --> 14:42.060
Why's the person who touched me saying that?

14:43.380 --> 14:45.890
I'm used to it from you by now.

14:45.890 --> 14:48.780
If it bothers you, then control yourself more.

14:53.250 --> 14:54.200
Here you go.

14:54.640 --> 14:56.790
It should help your fatigue, so drink up.

15:00.670 --> 15:01.750
So sweet!

15:01.750 --> 15:02.700
Drink it.

15:05.110 --> 15:06.620
Good job.

15:09.450 --> 15:12.180
Hey, do I have magical power, too?

15:12.490 --> 15:13.410
Yes.

15:13.410 --> 15:14.890
I had no idea.

15:14.890 --> 15:19.780
But in your case, you can't use magic 
so long as you wield Akashia.

15:19.780 --> 15:22.270
Guess I can't become a mage, then.

15:22.770 --> 15:25.980
Still, you should be able to see magic.

15:25.980 --> 15:28.030
Please pay it more attention
 starting tomorrow.

15:34.070 --> 15:36.200
This is scorching hot.

15:36.200 --> 15:39.130
Observe the flow of magic and cut through it.

15:39.130 --> 15:42.750
Find the spot that acts as the linchpin 
of the spell's composition.

15:46.810 --> 15:48.920
You make it sound so easy...

15:51.850 --> 15:53.700
<i>The linchpin of the spell...</i>

15:54.700 --> 15:55.760
<i>The flow of magic...</i>

16:14.940 --> 16:15.910
Is this it?!

16:22.990 --> 16:24.420
Well done.

16:24.420 --> 16:26.010
That was fast.

16:26.710 --> 16:29.480
Maybe I should have you face humans next.

16:29.480 --> 16:31.710
You sound like you're making bugs fight.

16:36.600 --> 16:37.600
Huh?

16:37.600 --> 16:39.680
Are you folks also here to challenge the tower?

16:40.900 --> 16:43.630
Just the people I was hoping for!

16:48.240 --> 16:50.570
Welcome to my tower.

16:50.570 --> 16:53.030
Are you saying you're the witch?!

16:53.660 --> 16:54.390
Indeed.

16:54.950 --> 16:57.830
You came here with a request 
for me, did you not?

16:57.830 --> 17:00.330
Emerge victorious in a fight against him.

17:00.330 --> 17:03.120
If you do, I'll grant your wish.

17:03.450 --> 17:04.200
Okay!

17:04.200 --> 17:05.660
Let's do this, everyone!

17:05.660 --> 17:06.580
Yeah!

17:08.490 --> 17:11.140
I'll make sure no one dies.

17:11.140 --> 17:13.050
So fight with everything you've got.

17:13.050 --> 17:14.170
I swear...

17:16.020 --> 17:16.940
Begin!

17:33.550 --> 17:35.200
Wow, incredible!

17:35.200 --> 17:37.910
That was better than I expected.

17:37.910 --> 17:39.940
I think we can make today our last day.

17:39.940 --> 17:41.390
You put a lot of hard work in.

17:42.040 --> 17:44.500
Can I win a fight against you now?

17:46.290 --> 17:47.830
I can't say for sure.

17:49.060 --> 17:53.710
If we knew the answer now, 
it wouldn't be any fun.

18:01.180 --> 18:04.030
It looks like it's brought back 
information on Cuscull.

18:06.960 --> 18:11.010
It appears that there are around 
two hundred mages gathered in Cuscull.

18:11.010 --> 18:12.520
Spirit sorcerers, too.

18:12.520 --> 18:14.270
That can't be!

18:14.270 --> 18:18.240
The average nation has anywhere 
from twenty to thirty mages!

18:18.240 --> 18:20.450
Are they planning to start a war?

18:20.450 --> 18:22.450
I can't deny the possibility.

18:22.450 --> 18:25.160
They aim to summon demons as well.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.920
You mentioned a palace.

18:26.920 --> 18:28.120
Are they a monarchy?

18:28.420 --> 18:29.920
It appears so.

18:29.920 --> 18:34.710
I don't know who their monarch is, 
but it's not the former lord of the domain.

18:34.710 --> 18:40.990
As a kingdom revolving around magic, 
there's a good chance that they're a mage.

18:41.540 --> 18:44.260
Can we have you continue 
to investigate the matter for now?

18:44.690 --> 18:46.430
I'm sure they're plotting something.

18:47.770 --> 18:49.390
It's awful, Your Highness!

18:49.390 --> 18:50.930
General Ettard...

19:01.490 --> 19:04.550
I'd heard he was in poor health.

19:05.530 --> 19:09.910
Miss Miralys, you entered the palace 
thanks to General Ettard, if I recall.

19:10.390 --> 19:11.440
Yes...

19:11.440 --> 19:14.270
He treated me so kindly
 for a distant relative.

19:14.750 --> 19:17.800
It's thanks to him that I'm here now...

19:18.470 --> 19:21.260
Both Als and I are indebted to him.

19:21.690 --> 19:25.900
Before Als entered the palace, 
Ettard gave him sword training.

19:25.900 --> 19:27.680
And me, after I was cursed...

19:36.810 --> 19:37.740
Your Highness.

19:38.650 --> 19:41.170
Despair eats away at people.

19:41.810 --> 19:43.940
Become a man of strong will.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.630
Do that, and results will follow.

19:47.870 --> 19:50.330
Don't you die before me.

19:52.690 --> 19:57.220
General Ettard's belongings 
will be left to his close friends.

19:57.220 --> 20:01.770
I've informed General Als 
regarding the curse on Your Highness.

20:03.750 --> 20:06.100
I never knew that happened to you.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.810
It's a real nuisance.

20:08.330 --> 20:11.770
Sounds real bad, 
unless Miss Tinasha marries you.

20:11.770 --> 20:12.860
Yeah.

20:12.860 --> 20:14.920
The direct lineage will die out.

20:14.920 --> 20:15.730
How about it?

20:15.730 --> 20:16.940
I said no!

20:16.940 --> 20:18.900
I'm doing the analysis, aren't I?

20:18.900 --> 20:20.780
What displeases you about His Highness?

20:20.780 --> 20:23.960
Wh-Wh-What, you ask?

20:23.960 --> 20:24.820
What was it again?

20:24.820 --> 20:26.190
Don't ask me.

20:26.790 --> 20:31.360
His problem is that he likes 
to poke fun at people.

20:31.360 --> 20:32.290
Maybe.

20:32.600 --> 20:33.880
Hey...

20:33.880 --> 20:37.810
That said, we have more than 
half a year left on our contract.

20:37.810 --> 20:39.500
I'm sure things will work out.

20:40.740 --> 20:41.970
I sure hope so.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.390
Oh, I'm sorry.

20:52.140 --> 20:53.600
Are you okay?

20:53.970 --> 20:56.060
Only the lid ended up cracking.

20:56.890 --> 20:58.320
Can't you fix it?

20:58.320 --> 21:01.280
I can't undo what has been broken.

21:01.680 --> 21:06.610
I may be able to stop time, 
but I can't turn time back.

21:06.610 --> 21:07.490
I'm sorry.

21:07.990 --> 21:10.880
I guess magic has its limits, too.

21:10.880 --> 21:13.830
All living things share the same fate of death.

21:23.390 --> 21:25.260
H-Help...

21:26.390 --> 21:28.760
You don't know who I am, do you?

21:29.380 --> 21:31.370
You've got some nerve showing yourself here.

21:31.970 --> 21:35.850
Your lord killed him in front of my eyes.

21:36.390 --> 21:40.070
Even if I could redo it all, 
that sin will not wash away.

21:40.740 --> 21:41.480
Understand?

21:43.700 --> 21:45.190
Lord Lanak...

23:35.390 --> 23:39.930
~ Unnamed Emotion ~
